B.a3E=new A.b5("YCYC charges mechanics 15% of the job price. The customer pays the job price plus their own 5% service fee on top, which does not come out of your share.")
B.a48=new A.b5("Example: a 200 dollar job. The fee is 30 dollars, you receive 170 dollars. The customer pays 210 dollars (200 plus their 10 dollar fee).")
B.a4W=new A.b5("Approved additional work follows the same rule.")
