B.acV=s([B.a2B,B.a3e],t.f)
B.a1V=new A.bf("c-disputes-evidence","What evidence helps","Clear, dated, and in the app.",B.acV)
B.a3J=new A.b5("When a problem is reported, YCYC may freeze the job and the held payment while it reviews. We may look at messages, photos, notes, check-ins, confirmations, ratings and anything else in the app's record, and we may ask both sides for more information.")
B.a4E=new A.b5("YCYC may decide, in its reasonable discretion, to release the payment to the mechanic, refund you in full, or split the payment, and may decide who was at fault. YCYC's decision controls how money held through the platform is paid out.")
