B.afX=s(["Check the mechanic's name and photo match the profile in the app before they start.","Have another person home if you can, or tell someone you trust that a mechanic is coming.","Stay in a visible, well-lit area and keep valuables put away.","Do not hand over your keys or move the car until you are comfortable with who you are dealing with.","If anything feels wrong, you do not have to continue. See 'I feel unsafe'."],t.s)
