B.acY=s(['Post your repair for free: pick your vehicle, enter the address where the work will happen, and describe the problem. Not sure what is wrong? Ask for a diagnostic. Already have the parts? Switch on "I have my own parts" for a labor-only quote.',"Mechanics within about 100 miles send bids. Only you can see them, and you can cancel for free until you accept one.","Compare price, arrival time and each mechanic's profile, then accept the bid you like. YCYC is a neutral platform and cannot endorse any mechanic, so the choice is yours.","Pay securely. Your card is held, not charged, until the work is done. A 5% service fee is added on top and shown before you pay.","Track your mechanic, confirm when they arrive and start work, and approve or decline any additional work in the app. Need a new time? Tap Reschedule.","Check the work, then release payment and leave a review. If something is wrong, report it before you release. Refunds are not guaranteed and are decided by YCYC on the evidence."],t.s)
