B.aRT=new A.fN(3,B.Ab,"Compare and accept","Look at each price, arrival time and rating, then accept the bid you like. There's no rush.",!1,null)
B.aRU=new A.fN(2,B.iM,"Submit a competitive bid","Set your price and the soonest you can get the work done.",!1,null)
B.aRV=new A.fN(6,B.kv,"You confirm and the mechanic is paid","Only after you say they finished diagnosing.",!0,null)
B.aRW=new A.fN(3,B.hj,"Accept a bid","Your card is held, not charged.",!1,null)
B.aRX=new A.fN(4,B.hj,"Pay securely","Your card is held, not charged, until the work is done. Your address goes only to your chosen mechanic, after payment is secured.",!1,null)
B.An=new A.at(984560,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aRY=new A.fN(1,B.An,"Describe your issue","Tell us what's wrong, or upload a quote you already have. Posting is free and nothing is charged.",!1,null)
B.aRZ=new A.fN(6,B.kv,"Release payment and review","When you're happy with the work, release payment so your mechanic gets paid, then leave a review.",!0,null)
B.aS_=new A.fN(2,B.A3,"Why we exist","Car repair shouldn't be a black box. Too many drivers get overcharged or talked into work they didn't ask for, with nowhere else to turn. YCYC puts that choice back in your hands.",!1,null)
B.aS0=new A.fN(1,B.An,"Describe what's happening","Tell us about the symptoms. The more detail, the better the bids.",!1,null)
B.aS1=new A.fN(3,B.kv,"Get chosen & paid securely","Payment is held in escrow and released to you once the job is done.",!0,null)
B.aS2=new A.fN(2,B.iM,"Get competing bids","Local mechanics bid to win your job and we notify you as bids arrive. Only you can see them. You can cancel for free until you accept one.",!1,null)
B.aS3=new A.fN(1,B.Ai,"Browse open jobs","New repair requests land here as soon as customers post them.",!1,null)
B.aS4=new A.fN(4,B.eT,"The mechanic comes and diagnoses","Same arrival steps as any YCYC job.",!1,null)
B.aS5=new A.fN(1,B.hi,"What YCYC is","\"Your Car, Your Choice\" is a marketplace where independent, local mechanics compete for your repair job by bidding on it \u2014 you're never stuck with a single shop's price.",!1,null)
B.aS6=new A.fN(5,B.kt,"You get the diagnosis in writing","It shows up in the app, and we let you know.",!1,null)
B.aS7=new A.fN(3,B.t7,"Built by a mechanic","YCYC was founded by a former mechanic who has spent years teaching people in underserved neighborhoods how to work on their own cars \u2014 this app runs on that same idea: give people real options and straight answers.",!1,null)
B.aS8=new A.fN(2,B.t9,"Mechanics bid hours","Each one tells you how many hours and their rate, and the total.",!1,null)
B.aS9=new A.fN(4,B.kv,"How it works","Describe your issue (or upload a quote you already have), get competing bids from real mechanics, and pay securely \u2014 your payment is only released once the work is actually done.",!0,null)
B.aSa=new A.fN(5,B.eT,"Your mechanic arrives","Follow them on the map or ask them to share their location. Your name stays private until they arrive. Confirm when they start. Any extra work needs your approval first.",!1,null)
